         <p>Late Antique, Early Medieval, and Byzantine Painting Photograph Collection, Arts Library, Yale University</p>
      </prefercite>
      <scopecontent id="aspace_sc">
         <head>Scope and Contents</head>
         <p>Collection consists of black and white and color reproductions of Late Antique, Early Medieval, and Byzantine painting. Content varies from original photographic prints to reproductions from magazines and other published sources. Some sections have accompanying clippings folders.</p>
      </scopecontent>
